AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:contributor obo:FOODON_00001304 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8844-9165>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_00001304 "food fermentation"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_00001304 obo:FOODON_03000711)
