AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_00004088 "The challenge here is to make a clean distinction between methods that immerse a cooking container in water or steam vs those that don't."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_00004088 "direct heating of container"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_00004088 obo:FOODON_03450032)

# Class: obo:FOODON_00004089 (heating liquid in container)

