# Class: obo:FOODON_00004348 (raw)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00004348 "A characteristic of organism material which has a biochemical composition that closely resembles its harvested or subsequent biologically aged state."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_00004348 "The definition covers plant, animal and fungi material, and allows for drying before harvest, and allows for cleaning, cutting, storing or trimming after harvest as long as harvested biological state is maintained."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_00004348 "raw"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_00004348 obo:PATO_0001995)

