# Class: obo:FOODON_03000617 (dehydration)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03000617 "A drying process in which water content of a material in a container is significantly reduced under controlled (not natural) conditions of temperature, relative humidity, and airflow."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03000617 "As indicated in the food \"(dehydrated)\" term, the boundary between the output of this process, dried or dehydrated material, can be ambiguous."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03000617 "dehydration"@en)
