# Class: obo:FOODON_03460275 (food meat liquid injection process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03460275 "LanguaL curation note: Used when liquid is injected into a meat or poultry is prebasted. Do not confuse with *WATER ADDED*."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03460275 "food meat liquid injection process"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03460275 obo:FOODON_03460130)

