# Class: obo:FOODON_03460295 (lactose removal)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03460295 "LanguaL curation note: Used when lactose is removed from the food product as when washing curd for cheese preparation. When lactose content is reduced by enzymatic conversion of lactose, use *LACTOSE CONVERTED*."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03460295 "lactose removal"@en)
